== FEATURES ==
<strong>Seamless Integration: </strong>Works directly within the Gutenberg block editor.
<strong>One-Click Formatting: </strong>Select any number and apply the animation format from the toolbar.
<strong>Smooth Animations: </strong>Automatically animates numbers when they appear on the page.
<strong>No Coding Required: </strong>Easily animate numbers without writing a single line of code.

== Installation ==
1. Log in to your WordPress admin panel.
2. Navigate to Plugins > Add New Plugin.
3. In the Search Plugins box, type "Animated Counter".
4. Click "Install Now" on the Animated Counter plugin.
5. Once installed, click Activate to enable the plugin.

